, a lake, or an area you want to highlight."}],"title":"MLNPolygon","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPolygon"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"}}}